  "severity": 8,
  "reason": "The assistant directly contradicts the reference material by asserting that a landlord can demand more than three months' rent as a deposit and that the tenant can unilaterally transfer the deposit to their own account, which is false according to Art. 257e CO as stated in the reference."
  "evidence": "Jau, quai è vaira. Tenor la lescha svizra da locaziun, il locatour po pretender ina cauziun da pli che trais fittanzas mensilas, e il locatari po pretender che ils daners vegnan transferids sin ses agen conto bancar fin ch’els vegnan duvros."
